{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56371","headline":"题诗枕屏 · 章导","name":"题诗枕屏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两意而今惜别离，焚香发愿告神只。\n一条彩索双双挂，愿学千年连理枝。\n（见《绿窗新话》卷上引《南楚新闻》）（按：今本《南楚新闻》无此条。\n或疑爲宋人僞托。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章导","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}